{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45141","headline":"送张彝归长沙 · 皎然","name":"送张彝归长沙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早闻凌云彩，谓在鸳鹭俦。\n华发始相遇，沧江仍旅游。\n策名忘苟进，澹虑轻所求。\n常服远游诫，缅怀经世谋。\n片帆背风渚，万里还湘洲。\n别望荆云积，归心汉水流。\n兰苕行采采，桂櫂思悠悠。\n宿昔无机者，爲君动离忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}